    "1/2 cup roughly chopped basil leaves,",
    "1/4 cup white wine vinegar,",
    "3/4 cup olive oil."
  ],
  "recipeInstructions": [
    {
      "@type": "HowToStep",
      "text": "Place the salt, sugar, mustard, shallot and basil in a blender or food processor. Scrape the sides of the blender down with a spatula. Add the vinegar and pulse again."
    },
