      "@type": "HowToStep",
      "text": "Turn the blender on low and take off the cap in the centre of the blenders lid and dribble in the olive oil."
    },
    {
      "@type": "HowToStep",
      "text": "Scrape down the sides of the blender and pulse for a further 2 minutes."
